{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600070","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1760007001:0":{"text":"과연 제가 눈여겨본 강자답네요. 더없이 멋진 전투였습니다!","source_cn":"不愧是我看好的新生代，为我们献上了一场精彩绝伦的战斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A7BEA288635E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1760007002:0":{"text":"그럼, 승자의 소감을 들어 보도록 할까요!","source_cn":"那么，有请我们的胜者发言——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EB3E84E0F58C122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1760007003:0":{"text":"내가 이겼으니까 이제 전에 말했던 소원을 이루어 줘!","source_cn":"我赢了，现在实现我之前许下的愿望吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB28AAD618B0B5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1760007004:0":{"text":"하하, 정말 직설적인 성격의 용사님이네요!","source_cn":"哈哈，这位小勇士的性格还真是直接呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25AEBD7823D3ABBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1760007005:0":{"text":"사람을 찾고 싶은 거죠? 걱정 마세요, 이 칼라는 한번 뱉은 말은 무조건 지키니까요!","source_cn":"你想找人对吧？放心吧，我曼卡拉说到做到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34DF861F699C3222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1760007006:0":{"text":"자, 여기 당신의 소원을 이루어 줄... 점성술사 사트라나를 소개합니다!","source_cn":"看，我已经帮你找到能实现愿望的人选啦！她就是——占卜师...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29DB9D4BC0F2794C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1760007007:0":{"text":"우와, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. 오랜만이에요!","source_cn":"嗨，<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x348B8334F48D1308","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우와, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. 오랜만이에요!","female":"우와, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. 오랜만이에요!","variant_male_record_index":"236732","variant_female_record_index":"236733","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1760007008:0":{"text":"찾고 싶은 사람의 생김새를 설명해 줄래요? 염정의 크리스탈이 길을 알려줄 거예요!","source_cn":"请向我描述一下那个人的长相和特征，炎晶之眼会为你们提供指引！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2CC892213F30D3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1760007009:0":{"text":"매튜는 사트라나에게 매우 신중하게 파피몬의 모습에 대해 자세히 설명했다...","source_cn":"大和详细谨慎、事无巨细地向萨忒娜描述了加布兽……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C41743F0FA2505E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1760007010:1":{"text":"듣기만 해도 아주 귀여운 아이 같네요. 좋아요, 맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"听上去是很可爱的小家伙呢。好，交给我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F1A096D43163735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1760007011:1":{"text":"시간의 흐름을 거슬러, 속세의 장막을 벗어나... 길 잃은 자의 흔적을 쫓아...","source_cn":"上溯时光之流，超脱世俗的迷障……追寻迷途者的踪迹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x008FD01D361C10F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1760007012:1":{"text":"아! 보여요... 떠다니는 책들, 드넓은 호수, 풍요로운 마력의 기운... 음산한 묘지... 책을 들고 수업을 듣는 사람...","source_cn":"啊！我看到了……漂浮的群书，广袤的湖泊，丰盈的魔力气息...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CD0A2F28E043DD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1760007013:1":{"text":"제가 볼 수 있는 건 여기까지예요. 짐작 가는 곳이 있나요?","source_cn":"我能看到的只有这些了。怎么样，有头绪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE877A7A5465D0223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1760007013":{"text":"제가 볼 수 있는 건 여기까지예요. 짐작 가는 곳이 있나요?","source_cn":"我能看到的只有这些了。怎么样，有头绪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE877A7A5465D0223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1760007014:1":{"text":"라이세움... 그게 어디야?","source_cn":"莱希拉姆……那是哪里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFD392DB97772F1A6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_targe